zenoh-c: build with panic=unwind

zenoh-c sets panic = "abort" in its release profile, but yocto's libstd-rs is
built for unwinding only, so linking fails.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [yocto libstd-rs is unwind only]

--- a/Cargo.toml.in	2026-11-12 03:06:49.758851713 +0100
+++ b/Cargo.toml.in	2026-11-12 03:06:49.760864514 +0100
@@ -124,4 +124,3 @@
 lto = "fat"
 codegen-units = 1
 opt-level = 3
-panic = "abort"
